        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p>Move faster from concept to cleared device with Macnica. We combine best-in-class components, reference designs, and applied engineering to help you build safer, smarter medical products. From imaging and surgical systems to wearables and smart hospital infrastructure, we supply technology, integration support, and a path to scale.</p>",
