      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Applications We Power",
       "id": "applicationswepower",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "flexcontainer_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontainer",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "1719484596357"
       ],
       "flexcontaineritem_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "Medical Imaging and Vision",
         "type": "h3",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p>Build sharper, lower latency imaging systems for endoscopy, ultrasound, digital pathology, and surgical visualization.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/sony-image-sensors.html\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sony image sensors and micro-displays</a></b> for endoscopy, ophthalmology, and surgical visualization<br>\n<br>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/canon.html\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245,245,245);\"><b>Canon's</b></a> medical-grade CMOS sensors deliver exceptional low-light sensitivity and signal fidelity for endoscopy, surgical imaging, and clinical visualization<br>\n<br>\n</li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera.html\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altera FPGAs</a></b> for real-time image processing, reconstruction, compression, and video transport</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/analog-devices.html\">Analog Devices</a></b> for ultrasound front-ends and complete signal chains</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/sitime.html\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SiTime MEMS timing</a></b> for stable acquisition and system synchronization</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/tq-systems.html\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TQ embedded video modules and computing platforms</a></b> designed for IEC 60601 compliance and sub-millisecond surgical video distribution</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/displays.html\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Macnica medical displays</a></b> for clinical monitors and mobile diagnostics</li>\n</ul>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
