      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Precision Timing",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/sitime.html\" target=\"_blank\">SiTime</a> MEMS oscillators and TCXOs deliver unmatched stability for acquisition systems, ensuring reliable synchronization across medical equipment.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0\">&nbsp;</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "table_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Product Class</th>\n<th>Typical Stability</th>\n<th>Power Profile</th>\n<th>Key Applications</th>\n</tr><tr><td width=\"25%\">MEMS Oscillators</td>\n<td width=\"25%\">±25–50 ppm</td>\n<td width=\"25%\">Ultra-low power</td>\n<td width=\"25%\">Patient monitors, wearables</td>\n</tr><tr><td>TCXOs (Temp Compensated)</td>\n<td>±0.5–2.0 ppm</td>\n<td>Low power</td>\n<td>Ultrasound, surgical video</td>\n</tr><tr><td>OCXOs (Oven Controlled)</td>\n<td>±0.05–0.1 ppm</td>\n<td>Higher power</td>\n<td>MRI, CT scanners, lab equipment</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Resonators</td>\n<td>±100 ppm</td>\n<td>Lowest cost/size</td>\n<td>Disposable medical sensors</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
       "textIsRich": "true",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "",
        "1722939215525"
       ]
      }
     },
     "container_15": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Signal Chains and Power",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/analog-devices.html\" target=\"_blank\">Analog Devices</a> provides AFEs, high-voltage drivers, and power management essential for ultrasound, patient monitoring, and surgical instruments.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0\">&nbsp;</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "table_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Subsystem/Function</th>\n<th>Key Features/Components</th>\n<th>Example Medical Applications</th>\n</tr><tr><td width=\"33%\">Ultrasound Front End</td>\n<td width=\"33%\">High-voltage pulsers, T/R switches, AFEs, beamformers</td>\n<td width=\"33%\">Portable and cart-based ultrasound, handheld probes</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Patient Monitoring</td>\n<td>Low-noise amplifiers, precision ADCs, ECG/EEG AFEs</td>\n<td>Bedside monitors, wearable vital-sign devices</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Imaging Power Mgmt.</td>\n<td>High-efficiency DC/DC converters, PMICs</td>\n<td>CT/MRI system power rails, digital pathology scanners</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Therapeutic Devices</td>\n<td>HV drivers, isolation ICs, power conditioning</td>\n<td>Defibrillators, infusion pumps, surgical tools</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Lab &amp; Diagnostic</td>\n<td>Precision signal chains, low drift references</td>\n<td>Blood analyzers, lab-on-chip devices, portable diagnostics</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
       "textIsRich": "true",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "",
        "1722939215525"
       ]
      }
     },
     "container_16": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Clinical Displays",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>Macnica offers <a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/displays.html\" target=\"_blank\">medical-grade displays</a> built for clarity, reliability, and long-term hospital use. Options include wide-angle IPS panels, anti-reflective glass, and disinfectant-resistant coatings.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0\">&nbsp;</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "table_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Display Type</th>\n<th>Size Range</th>\n<th>Key Features</th>\n<th>Ideal Use Cases</th>\n</tr><tr><td width=\"25%\">IPS Clinical Panels</td>\n<td width=\"18%\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">15–32”</td>\n<td width=\"32%\">Wide viewing angles, high contrast</td>\n<td width=\"25%\">Surgical monitors, diagnostic workstations</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Ruggedized Touch Panels</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10–22”</td>\n<td>Anti-reflective, disinfectant-safe</td>\n<td>Mobile carts, bedside monitors</td>\n</tr><tr><td>High Brightness Panels</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">12–24”</td>\n<td>Outdoor readable, &gt;1000 nits</td>\n<td>Field diagnostics, emergency transport</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Custom OEM Displays</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Configurable</td>\n<td>Integration with housings &amp; interfaces</td>\n<td>Specialized devices, kiosks</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
       "textIsRich": "true",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "",
        "1722939215525"
       ]
      }
     },
     "container_17": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
